  summary: 'How the skeletal system responds to a single exercise session (increased mineral uptake in bones from weight-bearing exercise), how it adapts to long-term training (stronger bones and ligaments), and additional factors: arthritis, osteoporosis and the effect of exercise on them, and the issues of resistance training for young children.',
